    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "language_select_guide_01",
      "hash": "50b9958ddb8c1d63",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要以哪種語言進行遊戲？\\n\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]語言一旦確定，\\n將無法在遊戲途中更改。[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n\\n不知道該怎麼選擇的時候，\\n請與家長或監護人一起選擇。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "language_select_guide_02",
      "hash": "50b9968ddb8c1f16",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要以這個語言開始遊戲嗎？\\n\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]語言一旦確定，\\n將無法在遊戲途中更改。[VAR COLOR(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "language_select_guide_03",
      "hash": "50b9978ddb8c20c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要以平假名還是漢字\\n開始遊戲呢？\\n\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]平假名／漢字可以在\\n遊戲開始前的「更改設定」選項中\\n隨時進行更改。[VAR COLOR(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "language_select_01",
      "hash": "eee174c0ff46f026",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "所選擇的語言"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "language_select_02",
      "hash": "eee173c0ff46ee73",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "開始遊戲"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "language_select_03",
      "hash": "eee172c0ff46ecc0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "重新選擇語言"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "language_select_04",
      "hash": "eee179c0ff46f8a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "以平假名進行遊戲"
